  "_comment": "One reward is given at each sunset. On a set day it is a big one, otherwise a small one. BIG ('rewards'): farm buildings and features. Each has the 'day' it arrives on (1 = his first finished farm day) and a 'value' naming a drawing in src/scenes/homeUpgrades.js; it has no emoji, because it is never shown as a picture: the sunset shows a present and the building is then built on the farm. Tent, cabin, farmhouse and bighouse are four stages of one home: only the best one he owns is drawn. SMALL ('small'): cosmetics, picked at random. Plain entries can repeat. 'once': true means it is given only one time. 'type' is friend or decoration (placed on the farm, the default), paint (truck colour; 'value' is #rrggbb or rainbow) or hat (for the robot). 'needs' names a building he must own before this can be given. 'sound' is the noise a placed thing makes when tapped: one of the names in src/systems/sfx.js.",
